      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain is both sensual perception and sense of touch, and it leads to emotional change of health, which has an effect back to a pain perception. Experience of pain is modified by intern and extern influences, and it can appear very multiformly in the chronicity. A part of these factors are described."},
